{"date": "2021-05-13", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0513.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:56+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "f90d45e31fb1d7d83261213c0322fd2651df9d1ac0accdb4cfa0f9cc58797155", "image_bytes": 122515, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 10 May 2021 08:39:18 GMT", "title": "宜怀念", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "黄金时代", "author": "王小波", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "那一天我二十一岁，在我一生的黄金时代，我有好多奢望。我想爱，想吃，还想在一瞬间变成天上半明半暗的云。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
